{"version":1,"content":"<p>劍橋大學與墨西哥數學研究中心（CIMAT）的研究團隊利用約6000年前的海洋沉積物記錄，重新評估北極冬季海冰的未來變化。研究認為，經過古氣候證據校正後，未來冬季海冰範圍可能比既有模型預測再少約100萬平方公裏，約合38.6萬平方英裏；這指的是相較先前預測的差異，並非北極海冰總量將減少這麼多。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583296.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:41.932101+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:59:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"5cfb223494ff153daa2404dcb913b9cdfe5e0a598dce88b5c797fc03cd157fbc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}